   <rms:rms_experience_0_description>Spearhead strategic outreach initiatives targeting international markets by identifying high-potential prospects, conducting market research, and planning tailored engagement strategies.
Lead the complete sales lifecycle, from the first discovery call to final closure, including presenting company expertise, showcasing relevant case studies, gathering client requirements including product features and functionalities.
Collaborate closely with the tech team to conceptualize and deliver Proof of Concepts (POCs) aligned with client needs; manage timelines, follow-ups, and ensure smooth coordination between clients and internal teams.
Develop customized proposals and pitch decks, drive commercial negotiations, and lead deal closures with a consultative approach.
Lead the global branding strategy of the company, including content optimization across digital platforms, SEO strategy, brand reputation management, and execution of thought leadership initiatives.
Build and nurture strategic partnerships and alliances to expand the companyâ€™s global footprint.
Ltd.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>true</rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_location>Pune</rms:rms_experience_0_location>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_role>Senior Manager - Branding &amp; Business Development</rms:rms_experience_0_role>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_company>Amura Marketing Technologies</rms:rms_experience_1_company>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>October 2021</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>1633046400</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>February 2023</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>1675209600</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_description>Build a thorough understanding of the client's brand, competitive landscape &amp; challenges and provide strategic guidance to increase digital footprints.
Grabbed business-level understanding majorly into B2B, B2C &amp; Healthcare industry segments
Defining the OKRs &amp; motivating the team to achieve defined goals
Drive internal projects to completion and enable team to address any challenges.
Key Achievements
Managed end-to-end closures &amp; built relationships with 20+ new clients; TOP BRANDS: Symphony | Uneecops | Art of Living | Enparadigm | VrLocal
Boosted company revenue &amp; managed reducing the churn ratio by 15%.
implementing new business strategies.
Conducted trainings &amp; helped the team for better industry understanding &amp; manage sales.
Team Management.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>
   <rms:rms_experience_1_location>Pune</rms:rms_experience_1_location>
