   <rms:rms_experience_2_company>Write Design Deliver Advertising LLP</rms:rms_experience_2_company>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>May 2021</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>1619827200</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>September 2021</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>1630454400</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_description>Managing and supporting the team to meet deliverables maintaining the timelines.
Interfacing with clients and suggesting them the most viable plan and building rapport for securing repeat business.
Managing accounts of key stakeholders acting as a point of contact, monitoring service levels through regular internal and external communication ensuring client retention.
Identifying target markets and analyzing current market trends to create effective business and marketing plans.
Maintaining weekly and monthly reports and discussing the same with the authorities.</rms:rms_experience_2_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>
   <rms:rms_experience_2_role>Business Development Team Lead</rms:rms_experience_2_role>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_company>Write Design DeliverAdvertising LLP</rms:rms_experience_3_company>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_dateBegin>June 2020</rms:rms_experience_3_dateBegin>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginTS>1590969600</rms:rms_experience_3_dateBeginTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_dateEnd>May 2021</rms:rms_experience_3_dateEnd>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndFormat>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndTS>1619827200</rms:rms_experience_3_dateEndTS>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_description>Generated and also converted inbound leads while maintaining a strong sales pipeline.
Organize weekly plans and manage workflow using efficient tools like CRM software.
Organized meetings and built rapport with the clients to address their promotional needs and thereby helping them with the most appropriate digital solutions.
Managed existing client inquiries and acted as the face of the company for new sales opportunities and creating revenue streams.
Reaching out and connecting with Influencers as a part of our marketing strategies to maximize brand growth.
Organized internal meetings to develop marketing and sales communication strategies.
Achieved monthly &amp; quarterly targets by close monitoring of follow-ups, ups, feedback, and queries.
Key Achievements
Built organic marketing strategies to drive more qualified leads &amp; grow the business
Managed clients end to end single handedly
Proven track record of building long term relationships with the clients &amp; ensure recurring business.</rms:rms_experience_3_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_3_isCurrent>
   <rms:rms_experience_3_role>Business Development Executive</rms:rms_experience_3_role>
   <rms:rms_experience_4_company>Santacruz TM SVSC PVT LTD - Spectrum &amp; Cox</rms:rms_experience_4_company>
   <rms:rms_experience_4_description>Dealt with international business and corporate clients and set my command over selling throughout all aspects of the sales process.
Utilized my empathetic skills to develop and maintain long-term business relationships with international clients resulting in mainly 30% of total sales through my referrals.
Closed new business deals and coordinated requirements while developing and negotiating contracts.
Collaborated with internal teams for the execution of sales and marketing strategies to overachieve the specified sales targets.</rms:rms_experience_4_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_4_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_4_isCurrent>
